flowchart TD
    Client[Android / evaluator] --> API[FastAPI]
    API --> Storage[MinIO photo bytes]
    API --> Queue[RabbitMQ scan]
    Queue --> Worker[GPU worker]
    Storage --> Worker
    Worker --> SAM[SAM 3 and geometry]
    SAM --> Vision[SigLIP2]
    SAM --> OCR[PaddleOCR GPU]
    Vision --> Ranking[Hybrid catalogue ranking]
    OCR --> Ranking
    Ranking --> DB[PostgreSQL results]
    DB --> API
    Catalogue[Reviewed catalogue] --> API
